// 289's book (general/scripts/book.rs2) on 530's two-page book (interface 49:
// title com6, eleven lines a page, com55-65 and com66-76, 197 wide; a model
// before each line in a layer of its own, com8-28 and com30-50 by twos; Back
// com51 and Next com53, pause buttons; page numbers com77 and com78; Close
// com5). 289 shows an obj by a line in a hidden layer (page_left_index_1 ...)
// around its model; 530's models stand alone, so each is hidden or shown
// itself.

// Page numbers, as void-634 writes them (BookPages.kt: the left page
// %book_page * 2 + 1, the right one more); 289's book has none.
[proc,book_page_numbers]
if_settext(interface_49:com_77, tostring(add(multiply(%book_page, 2), 1)));
if_settext(interface_49:com_78, tostring(add(multiply(%book_page, 2), 2)));

[if_button,interface_49:close_btn]
if_close();

